@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include style.puml
skinparam classBackgroundColor LOGIC_COLOR
skinparam nodesep 75
skinparam ranksep 75

package UI {
    class MainWindow UI_COLOR
    class PersonRecordListPanel UI_COLOR
    class LessonListPanel UI_COLOR
    class LessonCard UI_COLOR
}
package Logic {
    interface Logic
    class CanonicalLogicManager
    class CanonicalPeopleSession
    class LessonRetrieval
}
package Model {
    class PeopleView MODEL_COLOR
    class LessonQueries MODEL_COLOR
    class PonHubData MODEL_COLOR
}

MainWindow *--> PersonRecordListPanel
MainWindow *--> LessonListPanel
LessonListPanel --> LessonCard : immutable\nLessonView
MainWindow --> Logic : commands /\nobservable lists
CanonicalLogicManager ..|> Logic
CanonicalLogicManager --> CanonicalPeopleSession
CanonicalPeopleSession *--> LessonRetrieval
CanonicalPeopleSession *--> LessonQueries
CanonicalPeopleSession *--> PeopleView
CanonicalPeopleSession *--> PonHubData
LessonRetrieval --> PeopleView : resolve visible\nstudent once
LessonRetrieval --> LessonQueries : select / observe\nresult source
LessonQueries --> PonHubData : committed\nstate
PeopleView --> PonHubData : committed\npeople

note bottom of LessonRetrieval
  One stable read-only displayed list.
  Read-only context identifies student / filters.
  Switch catalogue / student / search source.
  No writes; people indices stay unchanged.
end note
note bottom of PonHubData
  Lesson-owned rosters are authoritative.
  Staged writes do not publish.
end note
@enduml
